; EditGerman -- WaveSmith in German in FS-UAE under MuForce and
; MuGuardianAngel (DEV:mutools), on PAL hires 640x256 at Topaz 8 (W=pal):
; the widest words of the bar (Laenge, Kuerzen...) must fit there. The
; program and its German catalog are copied to RAM:German (PROGDIR:
; there, so the catalog is found; nothing is left beside the test build
; for the tests after, which want WaveSmith's words English).
; DEV:Test/EditGerman.rexx reads the boxes from the trace: the main
; window's gadgets inside it and the bar's keys left to right, the Trim
; window's gadgets inside it; grabs edit-german.ppm and
; edit-german-trim.ppm.
;
;   gmake autotest T=EditGerman W=pal LIMIT=200
FailAt 21
Wait 8
Execute DEV:mutools
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/german.trace DEV:Test/Edit/Fit.wav DEV:Test/Edit/Fit.prl DEV:Test/edit-german#? ENV:WaveSmith.prefs QUIET
Echo >DEV:Test/auto.log "EditGerman"
Version >>DEV:Test/auto.log DEV:sasc/WaveSmith FULL
MakeDir >NIL: RAM:German RAM:German/Catalogs RAM:German/Catalogs/deutsch
Copy >NIL: DEV:sasc/WaveSmith RAM:German/WaveSmith
Copy >NIL: DEV:Catalogs/deutsch/WaveSmith.catalog RAM:German/Catalogs/deutsch/WaveSmith.catalog
Copy >NIL: DEV:Test/Edit/Single.wav DEV:Test/Edit/Fit.wav
SetEnv WaveSmithTrace DEV:Test/german.trace
Run >NIL: RAM:German/WaveSmith DEV:Test/Edit/Fit.wav
Wait 10
RX DEV:Test/EditGerman.rexx
Wait 3
Echo >>DEV:Test/auto.log "still running:"
Status >>DEV:Test/auto.log COMMAND=RAM:German/WaveSmith
Echo >>DEV:Test/auto.log "the trace:"
Type DEV:Test/german.trace >>DEV:Test/auto.log
UnSetEnv WaveSmithTrace
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/Edit/Fit.wav DEV:Test/Edit/Fit.prl QUIET
Echo >DEV:Test/AutoDone done
